#
# OCI 11.2's execute of SELECT DEREF(:1).name FROM dual with :1 a fetched REF,
# on Oracle 10g 10.2.0.5, the piggybacks ahead of it left out; the descriptor of the
# bind and its value are what tests.test_native11_calls reads.
# Captured 2026-11-08 through tools/capture_proxy.py: an OCI 11.2 program
# (instant client 11.2, x86-64 Linux, OCI_OBJECT mode; OCIBindObject of an
# OCIRef). The TTC payload, without the packet's header, as `hexdump -C` output;
# the offset column and the |ascii| gutter are ignored by tests.replay.parse_hexdump.
